{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"twig","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Twig and Jinja","description":"Syntax coloring and snippets for Twig and Jinja (.twig .jinja .jinja2 .j2).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"twig","name":"Twig and Jinja","extensions":[".twig",".jinja",".jinja2",".j2"],"grammar":"grammars/twig.json","blockComment":["{#","#}"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Twig and Jinja","path":"snippets/twig.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/twig.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<!--\",\n      \"end\": \"-->\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\{#\",\n      \"end\": \"#\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{%-?|-?%\\\\}|\\\\{\\\\{-?|-?\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:if|else|elif|elseif|endif|for|endfor|in|block|endblock|extends|include|import|from|set|macro|endmacro|with|endwith|not|and|or|is|raw|endraw)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\|\\\\s*[A-Za-z_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"</?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9:-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z:@-]+(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"/?>\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/twig.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"If\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{% if ${1:condition} %}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{% endif %}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"if block\"\n  },\n  \"For\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{% for ${1:item} in ${2:items} %}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{% endfor %}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"for block\"\n  },\n  \"Block\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"block\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{% block ${1:content} %}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{% endblock %}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A block\"\n  },\n  \"Extends\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ext\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{% extends \\\"${1:base.html}\\\" %}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"extends\"\n  },\n  \"Output\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"e\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{ ${1:value} }}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Output a value\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Twig and Jinja\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Twig and Jinja.\n\n## Files\n\n`.twig`, `.jinja`, `.jinja2`, `.j2`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- 5 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `if` | if block |\n| `for` | for block |\n| `block` | A block |\n| `ext` | extends |\n| `e` | Output a value |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}